From 6a2e0fee13421f8652b42cd26565c143bb6d5ef2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 Mar 2024 07:46:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bp: Add flatbuffers dependency

We added flatbuffers dependency in tensorflow and
that caused linker errors in packages/modules/OnDevicePersonalization

OnDevicePersonalization (lib)
  |----> federated-compute (this)
           |----> tensorflow
                    |----> flatbuffers (we added)

Change-Id: Ic9ed9a8ec3737a476b939815112c2de77c3f795a
---

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index dadc331..83ad0ac 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -122,6 +122,7 @@
     ],
     whole_static_libs: [
         "libtflite_flex_delegate",
+        "libflatbuffers-cpp",
     ],
     export_include_dirs: ["."],
     header_libs: [
